# Microchip PIC16F753 Configuration Word Definitions

# File Syntax:
# Each configuration register is given as:
# 
#     CWORD:<address>:<mask>:<default value>[:<name>[,<alias list>]]
# 
# for each CWORD the configuration settings are listed as
# 
#     CSETTING:<mask>:<name>[,<alias list>]:<description>
# 
# lastly for each CSETTING all possible values are listed as
# 
#     CVALUE:<value>:<name>[,<alias list>]:<description>
# 
# All numerical values are given in unqualified hex.  In terms of
# #pragma config, note the following correspondence:
# 
#    #pragma config CSETTING<name> = CVALUE<name>
# 
# The compiler may also emit a message when it detects certain programming.
# This behaviour is defined by the following record
# 
#     CMSG:<CSETTING name>=<CVALUE name>[,...]:<message number>
# 
# If the compiler encounters the given programming then it will emit the
# with the corresponding numnber.  Note that these records must appear last
# in the file.
# 
# Comments are also permitted.  Any line beginning with a '#'
# character will be treated as a comment.

CWORD:2007:3F79:3FFF:CONFIG
CSETTING:1:FOSC0:FOSC: Oscillator Selection bit
CVALUE:1:EC:EC oscillator mode.  CLKIN function on RA5/CLKIN
CVALUE:0:INT:Internal oscillator mode.  I/O function on RA5/CLKIN
CSETTING:8:WDTE:Watchdog Timer Enable bit
CVALUE:8:ON:Watchdog Timer enabled
CVALUE:0:OFF:Watchdog Timer disabled
CSETTING:10:PWRTE:Power-up Timer Enable bit
CVALUE:10:OFF:Power-up Timer disabled
CVALUE:0:ON:Power-up Timer enabled
CSETTING:20:MCLRE:MCLR/VPP Pin Function Select bit
CVALUE:20:ON:MCLR pin is MCLR function with internal weak pullup
CVALUE:0:OFF:MCLR pin is alternate function
CSETTING:40:CP:Code Protection bit
CVALUE:40:OFF:Program memory code protection is disabled
CVALUE:0:ON:Program memory code protection is enabled
CSETTING:300:BOREN:Brown-out Reset Enable bits
CVALUE:300:EN:BOR enabled
CVALUE:200:SLEEP_DIS:BOR enabled during operation and disabled in Sleep
CVALUE:0:DIS:BOR disabled
CSETTING:C00:WRT:Flash Program Memory Self Write Enable bit
CVALUE:C00:OFF:Flash self-write protection off
CVALUE:800:FOURTH:000h to 0FFh self-write protected
CVALUE:400:HALF:000h to 1FFh self-write protected
CVALUE:0:ALL:000h to 3FFh self-write protected
CSETTING:1000:CLKOUTEN:Clock Out Enable bit
CVALUE:1000:OFF:CLKOUT function disabled.  CLKOUT pin acts as I/O
CVALUE:0:ON:CLKOUT function enabled.  CLKOUT pin is CLKOUT
CWORD:2000:7F:3FFF:IDLOC0
CWORD:2001:7F:3FFF:IDLOC1
CWORD:2002:7F:3FFF:IDLOC2
CWORD:2003:7F:3FFF:IDLOC3
